zard Us Screenshots 8.png", "id": "225387073405453", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974821_225387076738786_2206746380928590219_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nbFwrQz_FZcQ7kNvwHKkzlD&_nc_oc=Adr_rdUgI2M3iGP7dgAcZ0itg2rRxAsubgFDl_JQPAiWJAsnbqDs9VyNaONVwc2VrTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFCx01ES93-XO8IiZBAphrUT4qI7tERkzsW82CTEWQXxg&oe=6A79AFEF"}, {"file_name": "Hazard Us Screenshots 1.png", "id": "182302187899578", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75388619_182302191232911_4048005859050525818_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xKxfDAYXbj4Q7kNvwGuw3QU&_nc_oc=AdqMEfueXRpBXbRIOJwSp35Om9XL5rlqtuePU0aBsWK_AC7fRK_lPk7sUv1jtAKCx9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEewxF66GpLVIiSKAvk3MNolxO-pNNsuTvjs7UFbD2exw&oe=6A79E6A1"}, {"file_name": "Hazard Us Screenshots 57.png", "id": "1289471586727084", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1289471596727083_5065689931402400009_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3dey6awQDO8Q7kNvwGraAAN&_nc_oc=AdrQdm4oYzig5kI6A-M-YeALwmGJW_ml2wRqZfuUmPcxpdLcFlMzzDUdQLB5wwxqdZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHFHQrw8RBrSEQmAY94PV3S33zvpO-QccqLS_ZEVKP97g&oe=6A79E63F"}, {"file_name": "Hazard Us Screenshots 36.png", "id": "1575141397466406", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619185_1575141404133072_1895727803405979598_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=36fCBb_GOZAQ7kNvwHU8jFf&_nc_oc=AdpoN4Q_mIQXuBUIuA8Kf45rFbRgBxFUGYoUOJGX66-vTggsF9SR726BahKvKaoM5g8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQExPTkVAINDlPETsMMtYsvHNWpiO5lhmpTL5Zksy148QQ&oe=6A79C26E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hazard Us Screenshots 6.png", "id": "1671348349962172", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982548_1671348359962171_3410448400815165034_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ah0oxBsxSxoQ7kNvwEzC7PV&_nc_oc=AdreFXh-rezZKYdswPaVaVB_hkcJGvkNPt1aArO2o63T160JeehtjCTQ5vRYWgjpl5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEhG4Up-oQSjQMjfl1vl5D_3sKUVTOLpgfQnyKCC4EAag&oe=6A79BA9A"}, "display_name": "Hazard Us", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf0b NEW ADVENTURE ALERT: Mount Boom has arrived in Hazard Us!\n\nGather your friends! Solve puzzles! Dodge traps! Die! A lot!\n\nIf you haven't tried Hazard Us yet, now's the perfect time. You and your fellow explorers meet at home base, step through a mystical portal, and hurl yourselves into chaotic, physics-based peril. Wits, reactions, and teamwork required. British accents optional but encouraged.\n\nWith Mount Boom, we've added a second adventure to the mix, a gloriously over-the-top supervillain volcano lair straight out of an 80s spy blockbuster. Two adventures. Endless hilarious demises.\n\nCan you escape with your lives intact? (Spoiler: probably not first time.)\n\n\ud83d\udc49 hazardusgame.com\nAlso on Steam.\n\nJoin the chaos on Discord \u2192 discord.gg/fN7MSreSev", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf0b NEW ADVENTURE ALERT: Mount Boom has arrived in Hazard Us!\n\nGather your friends! Solve puzzles! Dodge traps! Die! A lot!\n\nIf you haven't tried Hazard Us yet, now's the perfect time. You and your fellow explorers meet at home base, step through a mystical portal, and hurl yourselves into chaotic, physics-based peril. Wits, reactions, and teamwork required. British accents optional but encouraged.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 hazardusgame.com\n\nJoin our discord! https://discord.gg/fN7MSreSev"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.hazardusgame.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Make Real Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://makereal.co.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "co